commit 4e0018e7538ebc5c4bc220ea3785b012363e6bd3
Author: Feng Shu <tumashu@163.com>
Date:   Mon Jan 15 09:02:58 2024 +0800

    gnuhealth-control: get_lang conside pot file.

commit 2815b4aac4677c843f38bb380ef033107a0147af
Author: Feng Shu <tumashu@163.com>
Date:   Mon Jan 15 08:29:03 2024 +0800

    gnuhealth-control: get_lang use msgcat to merge po files.
    
    After gnuhealth-4.4, we use po-export tool to update po and pot files
    of gnuhealth, po files will sync to gnuhealth-hg-dev. which means that
    po items used in before gnuhealth version but removed in
    gnuhealth-hg-dev will be removed and not sync to weblate to translate.
    
    To solve this problem, we use msgcat to merge weblate's po files and
    installed po files, but removed po items can not lost, but they will
    be not updated with weblate, user should maintain them by manual.

