commit 48f2c7b688864d6799956012c86d4cb2b8a98132
Author: Feng Shu <tumashu@163.com>
Date:   Fri Dec 29 15:51:32 2023 +0800

    Restore and upgrade Swedish translation again.
    
    Kristoffer Grundström would like to maintain Swedish translation. so I
    retore sv.po files with the below steps:
    
    1. Restore sv.po files from 2d8de4e81fab (po-export.sh: export when translation progress > 10%)
    
         hg revert -r 2d8de4e81fab -I glob:tryton/*/locale/sv.po
    
    2. Run the below command to upgrade sv.po files.
    
         cd tryton/script/po-export/
         ./po-export.sh sv
    
    3. Do not change any sv.po in weblate until this change sync to
       weblate, reduce the possibility of file conflict merging.

