r31 | meanmicio | 2009-10-06 23:43:15 -0300 (mar 06 de oct de 2009) | 10 lines

- Fix Family assignment in patient form: Now it does not allow to assign an arbitrary family to the patient. The patient must exist as a family member or it won't show it on the form.
It checks before the family who belongs the patient, no matter what the operator puts.

- Added the list of essential WHO medicaments, based on the essential products. Filled in the active component

- Created a new category called "Generic" within medicaments. Theses are used to make generic prescriptions, without an specific brand. Specific brands medicaments will go in another category.

- Change de XML IDs on products from a number to "product_"[ID] notation.


